[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726851129","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104175#issuecomment-2726851129","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104175","id":2726851129,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iiHI5","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-15T17:49:09Z","updated_at":"2025-03-15T17:50:01Z","body":"This is done by design as a result of **Emulate Numpad** being enabled by default in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100059.\n\nWe could perhaps improve the behavior in case of a shortcut conflict (i.e. make numpad emulation a \"fallback\" that only applies if no other shortcut is found for the pressed key – if this isn't already the case).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726851129/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726929882","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104175#issuecomment-2726929882","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104175","id":2726929882,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iiaXa","user":{"login":"viksl","id":33526847,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNTI2ODQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33526847?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/viksl","html_url":"https://github.com/viksl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viksl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viksl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viksl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viksl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viksl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viksl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viksl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viksl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viksl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-15T18:47:29Z","updated_at":"2025-03-15T18:47:29Z","body":"I see. That confused me so much but why is this a default, are most people on laptops? I'd assume most people would be on a desktop with having a keypad?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726929882/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727041409","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104175#issuecomment-2727041409","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104175","id":2727041409,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ii1mB","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-15T22:49:22Z","updated_at":"2025-03-15T22:50:12Z","body":">  That confused me so much but why is this a default, are most people on laptops? I'd assume most people would be on a desktop with having a keypad?\n\nLaptops are likely more used overall than desktops worldwide. Even on desktops, it's pretty common for people to use keyboard layouts that don't have a numpad (TKL, or even 65%, 80%, and so on). Having a numpad is very likely to be the exception in 2025.\n\nBesides, the setting doesn't hurt to enable if you have a numpad anyway. It just gives you a second way to trigger the same actions.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727041409/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4291217476","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104175#issuecomment-4291217476","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104175","id":4291217476,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7_xshE","user":{"login":"Copperplate","id":16230743,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjMwNzQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16230743?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copperplate","html_url":"https://github.com/Copperplate","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copperplate/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copperplate/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copperplate/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copperplate/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copperplate/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copperplate/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copperplate/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copperplate/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copperplate/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-21T19:25:20Z","updated_at":"2026-04-21T19:25:20Z","body":"I was about to report a bug that any custom shortcuts assigned to the number keys were being **overridden** by the existing numpad shortcuts, despite the Editor showing different key bindings. Then I found this thread! Thank you so much for the info.\n\nI agree this behavior was extremely confusing initially, but thankfully the fix is as simple as disabling \"Emulate Numpad\" in the Editor Settings. 👍 \n\nI now successfully have the five \"Display\" modes (Normal, Wireframe, Overdraw, Lighting, and Shaded) assigned to 1, 2, 3, 4, and 5 respectively in Godot, **without the camera jumping around to different orthographic views.** :-)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4291217476/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]